  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "雞tiâu"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>藍春瑞</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">頭改掠入來飼ê雞仔囝有十隻，到tann賰七隻niā-niā，m̄-koh in ê身軀愈來愈大，原本起ê雞tiâu細細櫥仔，有khah狹--淡-薄-仔。好佳哉連suà有khiau三隻去，啊若無，早to kheh bē落--去。講是無幾隻，拄著透風落雨就親像櫳仔內ê犯人án-ne，規陣tsinn-tsinn做一伙，真正bē堪--得。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">今仔日6點起床，門口埕早就烏陰烏陰，山頭ê雲尪直透罩倚--來，看是kiōng-beh落雨ê款，kap昨hng比--起-來mā ke冷tsiânn濟，無來去起新雞tiâu仔bē煞。進前就有料算講，緊慢tio̍h-ài起新--ê，鐵網仔kap玻璃纖維浪板早to tshuân便便tng-leh等，tsit聲跤手若無khah mé--leh，thìng候雞仔囝沃著雨iah是拍寒--著，真正就bē赴市--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">先khàm厝頂，用塑膠管硩纖維浪板，一頭釘釘仔，另外hit頭縛鉛線，四箍liàn-tńg圍烏網仔tsa̍h風雨，to iáu未釘好勢，雨毛仔就來--ah。拄好大漢囝hiàm食晝，tuè手收家私歇睏。食飽the tī膨椅頂，bî差不多有半點鐘，就tiô起來戴笠仔、穿雨mua，m̄敢koh thōng--落-去。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Suà--落-去，鋪塗跤兜ê鐵網仔，寸尺有khah hai--淡-薄-仔，tio̍h-ài小可仔裁--過tsiah ē ha̍h。Koh beh hōo雞屎好piànn掃，鐵網仔下跤tshu玻璃纖維浪板，水tshiâng就家己流--出-去，免koh像íng過án-ne，逐工kā塗跤兜ê柴枋仔夯起來洗一liàn-tńg透。若是拄著好天iáu曝ē ta，落雨天ta̍p-ta̍p滴滴，舞kah bē得thang ta tsiah是歹剃頭。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雨愈來愈大，beh按怎kā雞仔囝tuì舊--ê趕去新雞tiâu仔--leh？頭一步先徙燒燒ê電火球仔，hōo新siū khah bē hiah生冷。拄仔好電線有夠長，thang吊起去kuân頂，免koh牽新ê線路。第二步提飼料槽仔起--來，kā khah芳ê新料添hōo tīnn，水槽仔koh換新水，將兩項做伙囥入去新tiâu仔內。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">上押尾ê khang-khuè是beh按怎趕--leh？過一睏仔久tsiah想著用枋仔圍一條細細條仔ê路hōo in行，ná沃雨ná khoo tsit陣tshuh目雞仔，我看in beh入去新siū ê時tsūn iáu leh tùn-tenn，心肝頭tám-tám ê款，規陣你看--我、我看--你，tsiah一隻仔一隻踏--入-去。我隨倚去kā雞tiâu仔門khian--起-來，thàng過門縫siam著in lóng khînn踮槽仔邊leh啄飼料、lim水，四箍圍仔koh真正有通風mā bē潑著雨，即時hōo我喘一下大心khuì，規身人ta鬆、輕可--起-來，穩心仔行入來厝內。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：<a href=\"https://reurl.cc/v0lvQN\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/v0lvQN</a>）</p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjuMIQicCCdFC6gxNf7yUxPLMQKYWK8N8iqN5aPf_uwlIm6bthkRIv8zNFemAx4pGeMJyUHnPP_xQnLEvzb2i26XSbtOorLlqx-cntSwDBG6MF1igC7bBG7uFwVChH8PJSZ4TcLc4ufgk1N4k3sSOMkOiqydcwrvOvptc1fjJ8YSm7dguGd7fN1I5hz8_U9/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1361%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjuMIQicCCdFC6gxNf7yUxPLMQKYWK8N8iqN5aPf_uwlIm6bthkRIv8zNFemAx4pGeMJyUHnPP_xQnLEvzb2i26XSbtOorLlqx-cntSwDBG6MF1igC7bBG7uFwVChH8PJSZ4TcLc4ufgk1N4k3sSOMkOiqydcwrvOvptc1fjJ8YSm7dguGd7fN1I5hz8_U9/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1361%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjW2T8z3oh3bSMF9HRdCnDGM7PX_CDmVC8GWenqO16vBNEFT3A8eF_kFOi5S-mUzGWyoiBqxkg2wUdEbIs7483BDUiyY463dMCOt5o9nIx8yeICiwhWmcIhblx4bzE1sSKeH63Ow7unPabo8dai0Z7GKyQKLYiLbXfVNYj1kDxz6q20w6qLu42cngHvAnBI/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1361%E6%9C%9F_05.jpg\" 